{"version":1,"title":"[BUAA CO P4]Verilog 设计单周期 CPU - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\" style=\"--bg-url:url('https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUEPx.png')\"><img class=\"lazy bg\" data-src=\"https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUEPx.png\">\n  <div class=\"content\" data-text-adaptive=\"split\">\n    <div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-bottom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"menu\" href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"proj\" href=\"/posts/444343b2/\">25 计组实验</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">730 字 · 约 3 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2025-11-17T13:19:44.000Z\">2025-11-17</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-04-09T15:01:59.159Z\">2026-04-09</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[BUAA CO P4]Verilog 设计单周期 CPU</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h1 id=\"序\">序</h1>\n<p>唉唉，又差一点把第三题做出来。猛攻 1h 以失败告终……不过起码通过了，开心~</p>\n<!--more-->\n<h1 id=\"第一题-CRR\">第一题 CRR</h1>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>31:26</th>\n<th>25:21</th>\n<th>20:16</th>\n<th>15:11</th>\n<th>10:6</th>\n<th>5:0</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<t